{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-architecture","title":"成本架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/cost-architecture","wordCount":1741,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本架构设计\">成本架构设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM 推理成本是沿调用链路逐层累积的系统问题——路由决策（选模型）、上下文构建（组输入）、推理计算（调 API）、输出验证（判成败）、Agent 循环（多步骤）、跨系统 Fan-out（多调用）六个节点各有独立的成本贡献和干预杠杆。用系统视角识别瓶颈节点，才能把有限的优化资源投向最高 ROI 的位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本累积的系统视角\">成本累积的系统视角</h2><p>LLM 推理成本不是一个&quot;点&quot;问题——它是沿着整条调用链路逐层累积的<strong>系统</strong>问题。每个架构层都有独立的成本贡献者和独立的优化杠杆。用系统视角看成本，才能识别最高 ROI 的干预点，而不是东一榔头西一棒子地随机优化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;鉴权/限流/路由决策]&#10;    B --&gt; C[上下文构建层&lt;br/&gt;System Prompt + History + RAG]&#10;    C --&gt; D[模型调用层&lt;br/&gt;API Call / Self-hosted Inference]&#10;    D --&gt; E[输出处理层&lt;br/&gt;解析/验证/后处理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[反馈循环层&lt;br/&gt;Agent Loop / Retry / Escalation]&#10;    F --&gt;|循环| C&#10;&#10;    B -.-&gt;|成本节点 1| G[路由决策&lt;br/&gt;选哪个模型]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|成本节点 2| H[上下文膨胀&lt;br/&gt;History + RAG chunks]&#10;    D -.-&gt;|成本节点 3| I[推理计算&lt;br/&gt;Input + Output tokens]&#10;    E -.-&gt;|成本节点 4| J[输出验证失败&lt;br/&gt;触发重试]&#10;    F -.-&gt;|成本节点 5| K[Agent 循环&lt;br/&gt;多步骤累积]\">graph TD\n    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;鉴权/限流/路由决策]\n    B --&gt; C[上下文构建层&lt;br/&gt;System Prompt + History + RAG]\n    C --&gt; D[模型调用层&lt;br/&gt;API Call / Self-hosted Inference]\n    D --&gt; E[输出处理层&lt;br/&gt;解析/验证/后处理]\n    E --&gt; F[反馈循环层&lt;br/&gt;Agent Loop / Retry / Escalation]\n    F --&gt;|循环| C\n\n    B -.-&gt;|成本节点 1| G[路由决策&lt;br/&gt;选哪个模型]\n    C -.-&gt;|成本节点 2| H[上下文膨胀&lt;br/&gt;History + RAG chunks]\n    D -.-&gt;|成本节点 3| I[推理计算&lt;br/&gt;Input + Output tokens]\n    E -.-&gt;|成本节点 4| J[输出验证失败&lt;br/&gt;触发重试]\n    F -.-&gt;|成本节点 5| K[Agent 循环&lt;br/&gt;多步骤累积]</pre><h2 id=\"六个成本累积节点\">六个成本累积节点</h2><h3 id=\"节点-1-路由决策-选错模型的代价\">节点 1：路由决策——选错模型的代价</h3><p>路由决策是成本架构中最早也是杠杆最大的节点。它决定了后续所有 token 的单价。一旦请求被路由到旗舰模型，无论输入多么简单，每个 token 都按旗舰价格计费。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路由策略</th>\n<th>成本影响</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量旗舰（默认状态）</td>\n<td>基线 100%</td>\n<td>原型期/验证期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态规则路由</td>\n<td>节省 30-50%</td>\n<td>任务类型清晰可分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类器路由</td>\n<td>节省 40-70%</td>\n<td>有历史数据训练路由器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cascade 级联</td>\n<td>节省 50-85%</td>\n<td>可接受轻微延迟增加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>路由器本身的成本通常可忽略：用 Nano 级模型做分类，每次调用成本不到 $0.0001。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节点-2-上下文构建-不可见的-token-膨胀\">节点 2：上下文构建——不可见的 Token 膨胀</h3><p>每次 API 调用的输入 token 由四部分组成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{input} = T_{system} + T_{history} + T_{rag} + T_{user}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中系统 Prompt 和 RAG 上下文往往是<strong>静默膨胀</strong>的来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>系统 Prompt</strong>：生产系统的 system prompt 经常在迭代中从 500 token 膨胀到 4000-8000 token（加安全规则、加格式要求、加示例），没有人定期审计</li>\n<li><strong>对话历史</strong>：默认发送全量历史，第 50 轮对话的 history 部分可达 15000-30000 token</li>\n<li><strong>RAG 注入</strong>：检索 top-5 chunks，每个 500 token = 2500 token，且检索质量不保证每个 chunk 都相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>审计方法</strong>：为 API 调用加一层日志，记录每部分的 token 占比：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TokenBreakdown {&#10;  system_prompt: number;&#10;  conversation_history: number;&#10;  rag_context: number;&#10;  user_message: number;&#10;  total_input: number;&#10;  output: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBreakdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  system_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  conversation_history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rag_context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user_message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  total_input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型发现：system_prompt 占 40-60%，history 占 20-40%，用户实际问题仅占 5-10%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节点-3-推理计算-输入输出的不对称\">节点 3：推理计算——输入输出的不对称</h3><p>这是成本实际发生的核心节点。两个关键不对称：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>定价不对称</strong>：输出 token 单价是输入的 3-8 倍</li>\n<li><strong>控制力不对称</strong>：输入完全由开发者控制，输出受模型行为影响</li>\n</ol>\n<p>优化策略在这个节点分为两个方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>减少输入</strong>：压缩 Prompt、管理 History、精选 RAG chunks</li>\n<li><strong>控制输出</strong>：max_tokens 限制、结构化格式约束、stop sequences、指令约束</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"节点-4-输出验证-失败重试的隐性翻倍\">节点 4：输出验证——失败重试的隐性翻倍</h3><p>当模型输出不符合格式要求（JSON 解析失败、缺少必填字段、内容不合规），常见做法是重试。每次重试意味着完整重新计费——包括那些完全相同的输入 token。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>重试成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>单次成本</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{重试成本} = \\text{单次成本} \\times (1 + r_{retry} \\times n_{retry})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重试成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果重试率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{retry}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 15%、平均重试次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{retry}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1.5，则实际成本 = 单次成本 × 1.225（隐性增加 22.5%）。</p>\n<p>降低重试的关键不是&quot;改 Prompt 让模型更听话&quot;——而是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 JSON Mode / Structured Output 在模型层面强制格式</li>\n<li>对非结构性错误做客户端修复（正则提取、容错解析）而非重发</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"节点-5-agent-循环-复合增长的根源\">节点 5：Agent 循环——复合增长的根源</h3><p>Agent 系统的成本结构与单次调用截然不同。一个典型 10 步 Agent 任务的 token 消耗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>输入 token（累积）</th>\n<th>新输出 token</th>\n<th>累积成本（相对首步）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>8,000 (sys + user)</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>1.0x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>8,500 (+ tool result)</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>2.1x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>9,400</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>3.4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>12,000</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>6.2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>18,000</td>\n<td>300</td>\n<td>12.8x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每步都重发累积上下文，成本增长接近三角数级别（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 形态）。这就是为什么一个&quot;看起来只花 $0.14&quot;的 Agent 对话，在规模化部署时月支出可达百万美元级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节点-6-跨系统调用-隐藏的-fan-out\">节点 6：跨系统调用——隐藏的 Fan-out</h3><p>微服务架构中，一个用户请求可能触发多个下游 LLM 调用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>意图识别 → 1 次调用</li>\n<li>RAG 检索后总结 → 1 次调用</li>\n<li>结果格式化 → 1 次调用</li>\n<li>安全审核 → 1 次调用</li>\n<li>对话存储前的摘要 → 1 次调用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个用户&quot;问了一个问题&quot;，实际产生 5 次 LLM 调用。如果每次都用同一个模型且不做任何缓存共享，成本是直觉预期的 5 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本架构的分层干预模型\">成本架构的分层干预模型</h2><p>将上述节点映射到可操作的干预层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>干预层</th>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>预期收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由层</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>难度路由、cascade</td>\n<td>40-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入层</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Prompt 压缩、history 管理、RAG 精选</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用层</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Prompt Cache、Batch API</td>\n<td>30-90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证层</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Structured Output、容错解析</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环层</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Token budget、摘要注入、提前终止</td>\n<td>30-60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编排层</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>模型分级、共享缓存、合并调用</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本架构设计原则\">成本架构设计原则</h2><p><strong>原则一：成本预算前置化</strong></p>\n<p>在系统设计阶段就把 token budget 作为架构约束——类似于延迟 SLA 和内存限制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AgentConfig {&#10;  max_tokens_per_step: number; // 单步输出上限&#10;  max_total_tokens: number; // 任务总 token 预算&#10;  escalation_threshold: number; // 超预算升级阈值&#10;  budget_exceeded_action: &#39;degrade&#39; | &#39;terminate&#39; | &#39;alert&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  max_tokens_per_step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 单步输出上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  max_total_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 任务总 token 预算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  escalation_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超预算升级阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  budget_exceeded_action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degrade'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'terminate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alert'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>原则二：成本与质量的解耦度量</strong></p>\n<p>不要用&quot;省了多少钱&quot;单一维度评估优化效果。正确的评估框架是帕累托前沿：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Optimization Goal</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Quality</mtext><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Optimization Goal} = \\min(\\text{Cost}) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\text{Quality} \\geq Q_{threshold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Optimization Goal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quality</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>质量阈值由业务场景决定，不同场景的容忍度差异可达 10 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>原则三：可观测性先于优化</strong></p>\n<p>在没有完整的 token 计量和归因之前，任何优化都是盲注。第一步永远是&quot;看清楚&quot;——哪个模块在花钱、哪种请求的 cost/quality 比异常、哪些时段出现了用量突增。</p>\n<p><strong>原则四：渐进式降级优于硬切</strong></p>\n<p>预算耗尽时的最佳策略不是直接拒绝请求，而是渐进降级：旗舰 → 中端 → 轻量 → 缓存结果 → 静态回退。每一级降级都有明确的质量让步和成本收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>成本架构的核心认知：成本不是一个点问题而是系统问题，六个节点各有独立杠杆；路由决策是最大单一杠杆（40-70%）；Agent 循环是增长最快的成本源（接近三角数增长）；四条设计原则（预算前置、质量-成本解耦、可观测先行、渐进降级）构成优化的方法论基础。后续三章的所有技术都是对这六个节点的具体干预方案。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"ai-cost-landscape\">AI 推理成本全景</a> 提供各厂商定价的详细基准数据</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本架构设计","id":"成本架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本累积的系统视角","id":"成本累积的系统视角"},{"level":2,"text":"六个成本累积节点","id":"六个成本累积节点"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 1：路由决策——选错模型的代价","id":"节点-1-路由决策-选错模型的代价"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 2：上下文构建——不可见的 Token 膨胀","id":"节点-2-上下文构建-不可见的-token-膨胀"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 3：推理计算——输入输出的不对称","id":"节点-3-推理计算-输入输出的不对称"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 4：输出验证——失败重试的隐性翻倍","id":"节点-4-输出验证-失败重试的隐性翻倍"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 5：Agent 循环——复合增长的根源","id":"节点-5-agent-循环-复合增长的根源"},{"level":3,"text":"节点 6：跨系统调用——隐藏的 Fan-out","id":"节点-6-跨系统调用-隐藏的-fan-out"},{"level":2,"text":"成本架构的分层干预模型","id":"成本架构的分层干预模型"},{"level":2,"text":"成本架构设计原则","id":"成本架构设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Token 经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/token-economics"},"next":{"title":"Prompt 压缩与 Token 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/prompt-compression"}}